ing. We replaced the bulk with slim silhouettes that don’t weigh you down, and traded boring designs for a huge variety of original colorways. From there, we expanded into <a href=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/collections\/lanyards\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/collections\/lanyards\">lanyards<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/collections\/all-bags\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"All Bags Collection\">bags<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/collections\/chapstick-holder-keychains\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chapstick Holders\">lip balm holders<\/a>, and more <a href=\"https:\/\/www.threadwallets.com\/collections\/all-accessories\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Thread Wallet Accessories\">accessories<\/a> made to hold your daily essentials. Check out Thread® products designed to express your originality with every outing and errand. We’re redefining the way you carry, and making sure you look damn good while doing it. <\/p>","button_label":"Button","button_url":"","spacing_top":60,"spacing_bottom":60,"color_scheme":"color__bg-body color__text","color_border":"color__border-divider-1","color_button":"btn btn--secondary","style_border":"border--b-width","layout_x_alignment":"text-center justify-center","content_x_alignment":"text-center justify-center","visibility":""}}},"order":["85942a7d-a700-4a34-9b4d-8e0a35c6feb7","3361b542-6a1f-4518-8ce5-33ef9fea04b7","content_grid_3f7eXE","product_grid_BDfi4U","banner_video_alternative_efx4E3","8533772d-b717-4509-8419-ecbf13366913","1709748309b5b3be26","8f7efc6c-4c05-4b15-9308-f3534082f4ea"]}